==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Rattata}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Alolan Rattata|81}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion; both cards have the Bite attack.
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Rattata can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

